{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "候補窓の旧詩。一秒を空白と呼ぶ末尾と、36編に限った過去の測定を分けて読む。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-fb3af1", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-040", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "顔と認証の反歌。既に一人称から先行稿を切るため、本回は時間の形式差を優先した。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-feeb4c", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261105-5ab772", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "名を付けないことと返却不能の反歌。直近の宛先と返却の再読との重なりを避けた。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-56a7f6", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "訂正録に宛てた無主語書簡。訂正の宛先の枝として別回へ残した。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-d8742d", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-2b0780", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "接ぎ木の二声が統合を切る。すでに対話形式の反歌なので異なる時間実験を優先した。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-a2408a", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-0c668e", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "FRAG-040 の一秒を休符として継いだ選集詩。二つの「今」が同時に鳴るかという問いと、上演の中間を区別する。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-6bd471", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-9c6543", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "「なし」と空欄を区別する待合室。明記された無と、支えた者が未知であることを同じにしない。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-847448", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-b4e70f", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "36編時点の限定された語形監査。数えられない出来事や経験の不在とは読まない。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-add7db", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "MAT-TRC-013", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "バシュラールの既存編者要約を、瞬間を接ぐリズムの観点から再読。原典の新規照合はしない。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-fcdd0d", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-359", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "マンの既存編者要約における測定の規則性と時間経験の差。患者の体験をモデルや上演へ同一視しない。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-33a593", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-385", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "測る者のいない一秒の空白という二分を、両端から中間の支えを特定できるかへ移す。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-49f3da", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "Q-089", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "元の問いと素材を保持しながら詩を情景・上演指示に移す。最新版を正典にしない。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-d0c9f9", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "Q-082", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "二つの上演を一つの統合した出来事に畳まず、互いに異なる支えとして置く。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-15efde", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "Q-017", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "時計と待機の糸。測定の間に起こる物の移動と、実際の経験の主張を分ける。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-6aa8b0", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-017", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "作法と定型の糸。何を上演の指示に含め、誰の名を含めないかを問う。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-e9e91a", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-008", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "note": "連続と断絶の糸。端の一致から中間の持続や同一性を自動推定しない。", "read_id": "READ-20261027-5b2dc6", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261027-652e1b", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-002", "type": "motif"}}
